:"良いことよね？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だからまあみんな無難に嫌いで苦手な臭いものをフィーチャーさせていただきました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/12/13/2489879/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この情けない背中を見てちょうだい。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"可哀想に..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"余程臭いもの食べさせられたのね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もー大人ってこわいっ笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"恐らく皆様が想像なさってるものをはるかに超える臭いもの食べてきました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いやぁよくやったよ18歳。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"我ながら、かなり頑張りました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆様、CDをご購入の際は是非、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"能條愛未のPV、ご覧になってみてはいかがでしょうか。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/12/13/2489879/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"質問返そ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Q  あっ、そうだ。一つ質問。唐突だけど、くまモン好き？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type